{
    "title": "PAW Patrol Academy",
    "description": "*** Google Play Winner Best of 2023! ***\r\n\r\nPAW Patrol to the Rescue!  This PAWsome app features interactive games for toddler boys and girls, plus real episode clips!  Designed for preschool and kindergarten kids ages 2-5, it\u2019s a brand-new way to experience the hit Nickelodeon show PAW Patrol, and the best way to get your biggest (or smallest) PAW Patrol fan smiling, laughing and learning.\r\n\r\nWHAT'S INSIDE PAW PATROL ACADEMY\r\n\r\nInteractive missions that your child can control\r\nParent-approved learning games to help kids practice topics like ABCs, spelling, counting, numbers, shapes and more\r\nHeroes in Training classes with the Mini-Patrol on emotions, self-care and life skills \r\nKid-approved activities like coloring and music dance parties to get your child moving and having fun\r\n\r\nMost exciting way to experience PAW Patrol yet!\r\nKids control the action and step inside Adventure Bay to enjoy their favorite TV, YouTube, YouTube Kids, Nickelodeon, Nick Jr. program!  \r\nKids become the heroes of their own adventure stories\r\nKids won\u2019t even realize it\u2019s productive screen time because it\u2019s so much fun!\r\n\r\nWell-earned free time for parents as preschoolers learn\r\nHighly immersive adventures and self-guided activities means frustration-free play for kids and much-needed break time for parents\r\nThis is what guilt-free screen time looks like!\r\n\r\nReal learning benefits\r\nCognitive: problem-solving, task-completion and focus\r\nSocial: communication, conflict resolution and community values\r\nEmotional: resilience, emotional intelligence. self-expression and confidence\r\nCreative: coloring, music and songs\r\nPhysical: fine motor skills, dancing and movement\r\n\r\nSafe and Easy. Ad Free. No Wifi Required.\r\nPAW Patrol Academy includes no third-party ads, can be used without wifi and meets the highest COPPA and GDPR standards because child safety is a priority.\r\n\r\nSubscription Options:\r\nPAW Patrol Academy requires a monthly or annual subscription to access all activities and additional content.\r\nPlayers can experience all the app has to offer by signing up for a free trial. \r\nTrial subscriptions automatically renew unless auto-renew is turned off at least 24 hours before the end of the trial period.\r\nYour account will be charged for renewal within 24 hours before the end of the current subscription period, and identify the cost of renewal.\r\nSubscriptions are managed by the user and auto-renewal may be turned off in your device's settings.",
    "descriptionHTML": "*** Google Play Winner Best of 2023! ***<br><br>PAW Patrol to the Rescue!  This PAWsome app features interactive games for toddler boys and girls, plus real episode clips!  Designed for preschool and kindergarten kids ages 2-5, it\u2019s a brand-new way to experience the hit Nickelodeon show PAW Patrol, and the best way to get your biggest (or smallest) PAW Patrol fan smiling, laughing and learning.<br><br>WHAT&#39;S INSIDE PAW PATROL ACADEMY<br><br>Interactive missions that your child can control<br>Parent-approved learning games to help kids practice topics like ABCs, spelling, counting, numbers, shapes and more<br>Heroes in Training classes with the Mini-Patrol on emotions, self-care and life skills <br>Kid-approved activities like coloring and music dance parties to get your child moving and having fun<br><br>Most exciting way to experience PAW Patrol yet!<br>Kids control the action and step inside Adventure Bay to enjoy their favorite TV, YouTube, YouTube Kids, Nickelodeon, Nick Jr. program!  <br>Kids become the heroes of their own adventure stories<br>Kids won\u2019t even realize it\u2019s productive screen time because it\u2019s so much fun!<br><br>Well-earned free time for parents as preschoolers learn<br>Highly immersive adventures and self-guided activities means frustration-free play for kids and much-needed break time for parents<br>This is what guilt-free screen time looks like!<br><br>Real learning benefits<br>Cognitive: problem-solving, task-completion and focus<br>Social: communication, conflict resolution and community values<br>Emotional: resilience, emotional intelligence. self-expression and confidence<br>Creative: coloring, music and songs<br>Physical: fine motor skills, dancing and movement<br><br>Safe and Easy. Ad Free. No Wifi Required.<br>PAW Patrol Academy includes no third-party ads, can be used without wifi and meets the highest COPPA and GDPR standards because child safety is a priority.<br><br>Subscription Options:<br>PAW Patrol Academy requires a monthly or annual subscription to access all activities and additional content.<br>Players can experience all the app has to offer by signing up for a free trial. <br>Trial subscriptions automatically renew unless auto-renew is turned off at least 24 hours before the end of the trial period.<br>Your account will be charged for renewal within 24 hours before the end of the current subscription period, and identify the cost of renewal.<br>Subscriptions are managed by the user and auto-renewal may be turned off in your device&#39;s settings.",
